messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/dbs/tiff-bi.c
Line: 64
Function: main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: malloc(WIDTH / 8) at line 61 is not checked for failure. If it returns NULL, the subsequent write scan_line[i] = 0; at line 64 (and later accesses at lines 66, 72, 75, and uses in TIFFWriteScanline) dereferences a NULL pointer, causing a crash.

